+/-! ## Vinogradov schema -/
+
+/-- Schema for the ternary Goldbach theorem (Vinogradov–Helfgott).
+The analytic core is isolated as a hypothesis; this shows how future
+formalization of the circle method can plug into the formal framework. -/
+theorem vinogradov_schema
+    (N : ℕ)
+    (hAnalytic : ∀ n : ℕ, Odd n → n ≥ N → HasOddVinogradovDecomposition n) :
+    ∀ n : ℕ, Odd n → n ≥ N → HasOddVinogradovDecomposition n :=
+  hAnalytic
+
 
